            </p>

            <nav class="space-y-1">
                <a href="/Profile"
                   class="group flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-3 py-3 text-slate-600 transition hover:bg-teal-50 hover:text-teal-700">
                    <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 transition group-hover:bg-teal-100 group-hover:text-teal-600">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-user"></i>
                    </span>
                    <span class="flex-1">
                        <span class="block text-sm font-semibold">My Profile</span>
                        <span class="mt-0.5 block text-xs text-slate-400">Personal details and account info</span>
                    </span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-xs text-slate-300"></i>
                </a>

                <a href="/Security"
                   class="group flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-3 py-3 text-slate-600 transition hover:bg-teal-50 hover:text-teal-700">
                    <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 transition group-hover:bg-teal-100 group-hover:text-teal-600">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                    </span>
                    <span class="flex-1">
